 Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">June 18, 1999<br/>Beta 5.0</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20050613013254&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Brass_Armor_128ff9.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a brass armor <span class=\"p-attributes\">(Arm:8)</span>.<br/>Classification: 1 Tier: 0.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 80.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Most likely the first chest armor players get on Main. Part of the Brass Set.<br/>This can also be gotten by <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20of%20Rust%20Remover\">unrusting</a> a Heavily Rusted Armor, <a href=\"#/wiki/Rusted%20Armor\">Rusted Armor</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Slightly%20Rusted%20Armor\">Slightly Rusted Armor</a>.<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a> can also get this armor on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Island%20of%20Destiny\">Island of Destiny</a> and in <a href=\"#/wiki/Dawnport\">Dawnport</a>. Due to a bug, the armor was also briefly brought to <a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a> from Dawnport.<br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bandit\">Bandit</a></